  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When calling RequestSerialization(), we expect that OnPreSerialization() / OnPostSerialization() is called afterwards from VRChat. This doesn't happen however when we are alone in an instance, since no data is sent over network then, even after calling RequestSerialization(). \nThis makes networking logic more complicated then it needs to be. \nIt would be better if VRChat would check if playercount is 1 and directly call OnPreSerialization() / OnPostSerialization() with result.success when RequestSerialization() is being called, even when no data is serialized in reality.",
